This fixture is DISTRIBUTION-ONLY. It must never be copied to a consumer.

Its subject is the `--arms` selection mode of scripts/validate-enforcement-map.sh and the
arm-boundary grammar scripts/render-invariant-index.sh serves it. Neither script is
installed: install.sh copies core/scripts/ to scripts/ai-dlc/, and both of these live in
this repository's own repo-root scripts/ directory, which reaches no consumer at all.

On a consumer this fixture would resolve no validator and no renderer. It could only report
that it found nothing to select, which is the reading a fixture must never be able to give.
